#: legacyimport.cpp:23
msgid ""
"<QT><b>Legacy Theme Importer</b>"
"<P>KDE now supports utilizing older themes from other platforms in your new "
"KDE desktop. The most common type of legacy theme is for the GTK toolkit, "
"which is imported to KDE's Control Center with this utility."
"<P>In order to do this you must specify at least one item: the folder where "
"the pixmaps for the theme is located. You may also have to specify the "
"theme's gtkrc file if it's not in the same folder as the pixmaps. Both are "
"usually in the folder \"gtk\" inside the theme's folder.</QT>"
msgstr ""

